            "title": "Lists and duplicates",
            "id": 89320,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A differenza dei set, le liste come <code>grocery_list</code> consentono valori duplicati, come <code>\"broccoli\"</code> in questo caso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"broccoli\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"broccoli\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89321,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per eliminare i duplicati da una lista come <code>grocery_list</code>, possiamo trasformarla in un set con <code>set()</code> e la lista tra parentesi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(grocery_list))\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'broccoli', 'milk', 'cereal'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>set</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>grocery_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store in variable",
            "id": 89322,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando una lista, <code>set()</code> ci fornisce un insieme dei valori unici della lista, che possiamo poi memorizzare in una variabile come <code>grocery_set</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grocery_set = set(grocery_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(grocery_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'broccoli', 'milk', 'cereal'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>grocery_set</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>set(grocery_list)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza i valori univoci di <code>grocery_list</code> in <code>grocery_set</code>, poi visualizza il set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grocery_set = set(grocery_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(grocery_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list(grocery_list)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>grocery_set</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>set(grocery_list)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Lists and duplicates",
            "id": 89417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la differenza tra gli insiemi e le liste in termini di valori duplicati?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le liste consentono duplicati, mentre gli insiemi no</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I set consentono duplicati, mentre le liste no</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le liste consentono duplicati, mentre gli insiemi no.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le liste consentono valori duplicati, mentre i set no.</p><p>Per <code>tags = [\"new\", \"sale\", \"new\"]</code>, quanti valori contengono <code>tags</code> e <code>set(tags)</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La lista contiene <code>3</code> valori e il set ne contiene <code>2</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le raccolte contengono <code>3</code> valori.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La lista contiene <code>2</code> valori e il set ne contiene <code>3</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La lista contiene <code>3</code> valori e il set ne contiene <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89418,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è un modo semplice per eliminare i valori duplicati da un elenco?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Convertire la lista in un set per eliminare i duplicati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Scorrere l'elenco per rimuovere i duplicati</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Convertire la lista in un set per eliminare i duplicati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un modo semplice per eliminare i duplicati da una lista è convertirla in un set.</p><p>Hai <code>names = [\"Ana\", \"Bo\", \"Ana\"]</code>.</p><p>Quale riga memorizza i valori univoci di <code>names</code> in <code>unique_names</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>unique_names = set(names)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>unique_names = names</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>names = set(unique_names)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>unique_names = set(names)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store in variable",
            "id": 89419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa possiamo ottenere da <code>set()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un insieme basato sulla raccolta di valori tra parentesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un elenco basato sull'insieme tra parentesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un insieme basato sulla raccolta di valori tra parentesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>set()</code> crea un set dalla raccolta inserita tra le sue parentesi.</p><p>Cosa produce <code>set([\"a\", \"a\", \"b\"])</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un set contenente <code>\"a\"</code> e <code>\"b\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una lista contenente <code>\"a\"</code> e <code>\"b\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un set contenente due valori <code>\"a\"</code> distinti e un valore <code>\"b\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un set contenente <code>\"a\"</code> e <code>\"b\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89421,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elimina i duplicati da <code>drinks_list</code> usando l'istruzione <code>set()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(drinks_list))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'chai', 'americano', 'espresso', 'matcha'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>set</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>drinks_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza ogni bevanda di <code>drinks_list</code> una sola volta convertendo la lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(drinks_list))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tuple\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>set</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Store in variable",
            "id": 89422,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la variabile <code>drinks_set</code> che memorizza il risultato dell'applicazione di <code>set()</code> su <code>drinks_list</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"drinks_set = set(drinks_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(drinks_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'matcha', 'americano', 'chai', 'espresso'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>drinks_set</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>set</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza ogni bevanda di <code>drinks_list</code> una sola volta in <code>drinks_set</code>, poi visualizza il set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"drinks_set = set(drinks_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(drinks_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tuple\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>drinks_set</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>set</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
